Application Overview
This is an institutional-grade algorithmic trading platform for Indian financial markets (NSE/BSE via AngelOne) and global crypto markets (BTC via Binance/Delta Exchange/Coinbase). The system operates 600+ live strategies simultaneously, supports paper trading with $1M virtual accounts for validation, runs real-time backtesting with walk-forward validation, and provides a professional web terminal for monitoring and control.

Business Objectives:

Automate high-frequency and swing trading strategies across asset classes
Provide institutional-quality risk management (position sizing, drawdown limits, circuit breakers, kill switches)
Run parallel paper/live trading to validate strategies before capital deployment
Generate systematic alpha through 600+ concurrent strategies filtered by a WINNERS_ONLY gate
Support full regulatory audit trail and trade certification for Indian market compliance
User Personas:

Proprietor/Quant Trader (primary) — monitors live P&L, configures strategies, manages risk parameters
AI Orchestrator — automated strategy promotion/demotion, signal validation
Auditor — reviews trade history, strategy performance, risk logs
