Paper trading ($1M BTC + NIFTY paper accounts)
Strategy backtesting (walk-forward, replay)
Risk monitoring (portfolio heat, daily loss limits, kill switch)
Options selling (NIFTY options, BTC options)
Strategy Evidence Program (SEP) — systematic strategy validation pipeline
