Backend Architecture (Go Engine)
Services: 35+ internal packages (see Phase 5). Key processing pipeline:


main.go (antigravity)
  → Boot: DB connections, strategy registry, BTC/NIFTY paper accounts
  → HTTP server (:8080) with middleware (auth, CORS, rate limit)
  → Market data goroutines (Coinbase WS, Binance REST, AngelOne)
  → Strategy evaluation loop (engine/internal/trading/loop.go)
