Infrastructure Architecture
No Kubernetes in production — configs exist in infrastructure/kubernetes/ but not deployed to production. Engine runs directly on AWS Lightsail single instance.
Docker: engine/Dockerfile + client/Dockerfile + docker-compose.prod.yml for local/staging
Databases: All cloud-managed (MongoDB Atlas, PostgreSQL Neon, Redis) — NOT on Lightsail
Monitoring: Prometheus client embedded in Go engine. Grafana config at /grafana/. Loki config at infrastructure/loki/.
